cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis code, please cite the archived software release."
title: "R code for pressure-dependent disagreement between oscillometric and invasive arterial pressure measurements in anaesthetized pigs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yoshida"
    given-names: "Kota"
    affiliation: "Miyazaki University"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - blood pressure
  - swine
  - oscillometric blood pressure
  - invasive arterial pressure
  - method comparison
  - Bland-Altman
  - generalized estimating equations
abstract: >-
  Final verified R scripts used to reproduce the revised analyses for a retrospective
  method-comparison study of oscillometric and invasive arterial pressure measurements
  in anaesthetized pigs. Animal-level source data are not distributed because they are
  corporate records of Boston Scientific Japan K.K.
